id: SLS-015
title: Missing DLQ on SQS/Lambda
category: reliability
severity: warning
engine: absence
target:
  extensions: .yaml .yml
  filenames: serverless.yml serverless.yaml template.yaml
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ .git/ vendor/ node_modules/
  content_contains: Type: AWS::SQS::Queue
patterns:
  - regex: (deadLetterTargetArn|RedrivePolicy|onError|deadLetterQueue)
    message: "No dead letter queue — failed messages are silently lost"
fix: Add a RedrivePolicy with deadLetterTargetArn and maxReceiveCount. For Lambda, add onError or destinations.onFailure.